The farmer in the house referred to in the previous question (Q. 34) decides to build a  work 
shed on his land close to the power pole mentioned containing a large saw mill machine for cutting logs. This machine draws a current of 60 A whilst it is running. He connects the shed cables to the transformer. 
\par }\pard \s22\qj \li709\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin709\itap0 {The effect this machine will have on the voltage at the house and the correct reason is:
