\par }\pard\plain \s18\ql \fi-595\li1304\ri0\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin1304\itap0 \f1\fs24\lang3081\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3081\langfenp1033 {B. \tab There will be a 
large voltage drop in the house wires as more current is drawn by the saw, which will lower the house voltage
\par }\pard\plain \ql \fi-595\li1304\ri0\sa120\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin1304\itap0 \f1\fs24\lang3081\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp3081\langfenp1033 {C. \tab 
